## Architecture

All services are containerized (distroless images) and deployed to Kubernetes
with Kustomize. See [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md) for details.

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
| --- | --- |
| Services | Go |
| Configuration | Environment variables, `.env` for local runs |
| Containers | Docker-compatible runtime, distroless images |
| Deployment | Kubernetes, Kustomize |
| CI/CD | GitHub Actions, GHCR |

## Getting Started

Prerequisites, both development workflows, and troubleshooting are in
[CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md). The fastest path:

```sh
cd src/services/__SERVICE__
cp .env.example .env
go run .
```

## Repository Layout

```
src/services/<name>/   Go services, one module each (see go.work)
src/pkg/               Shared Go libraries
infra/k8s/             Kustomize base, local, and prod overlays
docs/                  Architecture and development guides
tests/                 Integration and E2E tests
.github/workflows/     CI and image publishing
```

